-- ============================================================================
-- riskchange ASSOCIATE DEEP SEED: Risk, Change & Learning, beginner tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: RISK: THE SCORE, THE BAND, THE RESIDUAL AND THE DATE.
-- Five whole levels on two axes and a score that is their product; four bands
-- found by their lower edges; the residual falling back to the inherent level
-- one axis at a time; appetite against a target with a third answer that
-- declines; whole days between calendar dates; and a register counted by band
-- over a population the caller chooses. It ends on the OBODO register.
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. Every status here is a rule over a record and
-- an as-of date. The engines default that date to the machine clock; this
-- course hands them 2026-10-01 on every call, and every dated status it quotes
-- is true on that date.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A blank residual axis falls back to the
-- inherent level on that axis alone, while an off-scale level leaves the
-- residual unscored; and the same register gives different band counts for
-- every population and score a caller picks. The capstone grades both.
--
-- HELD, taught as a limit and never graded: a band is found by its lower edge
-- alone. (isReviewOverdue now asks the status first; ASC-0 repaired RC-2.)
-- IGBARA's two day counts are daysUntil on live risks' review dates.
-- ============================================================================

